  "scopes": {
    "red-receipt.json.raw": "v1 production admission red: actual same-owner handshake missing/unsupported was incorrectly admitted (Ok instead of AUDIO_UNKNOWN/UNSUPPORTED),1passed2failed,exit101. This is the original demonstrated missing production gate, not a compiler/test-author failure.",
    "green-receipt.json.raw": "v1 after production audio gate/parser/capture implementation:14audio tests passed. Evidence applies to exact v1 inputs.",
    "regression-receipt.json.raw": "v1 regression:42prompt tests passed1real-Agent test ignored;9draft_attachment tests passed;cargo fmt0. Only controlled/local paths were executed.",
    "v2-capture-receipt.json.raw": "v2 real safe read_audio_input capture and expected-source reread with7independent smallWAV fixtures;15audio tests plusfmt passed. Later formatting changes do not rewrite this run identity.",
    "v4-aggregate-receipt.json.raw": "Test-author compilation failure E0277: newtest tried LowerHex on currentsha2 output,exit101,no tests executed. Corrected only test hex formatting. Its raw boundary describes intended assertions, not actual results.",
    "v4-aggregate-compile-fix-receipt.json.raw": "Test-author cleanup failure:15passed1failed at final disconnect after exactaggregate/wire assertions. Cancellation delivery was mistaken for completed cancellation; busyguard correctly rejected. Corrected only test to await real turnEnd cancelled; no productionfix claimed.",
    "v4-aggregate-final-receipt.json.raw": "v4 final16audio tests andfmt passed;451inputs stable. Actualconnection rejects16MiB+2 completefilebytes beforecontrol although PCM sum is16MiB-86; real controlled ACP JSONRPC peer receives exact16MiB pair as two ordered wholebyteaudio blocks,then confirms cancelled. Peer is synthetic,not an installedAgent.",
    "source-freeze-v4.json.raw": "Original21-file backend freeze including compactseed/oracle. Fullseven pending at freeze time; publication neither changes that statement nor claims a newwhole-project run."
  },
  "boundaries": [
    "Every copied file is a regular UTF-8 file from the exact synthetic backend sourceRoot; no recursive traversal of embedded path references. Logs were read and matched against receipt SHA before copying. No private database/body,credential,real-account or installed-Agent material is included.",
    "red/green receipts give log SHA without filename; green.stdout/stderr and red.stdout/stderr are matched by their exact stored SHA and explicitly mapped here. No original receipt was edited to add paths.",
    "Only8requestedJSON originals and22directstdout/stderr logs copied with.raw suffix. No largeWAV,data tables,fullinput inventories,generators,oldpublicevidence or separately linked predecessorfreezes copied.",
    "Source references inside originals intentionally remain unchanged. This mapping locates published originals; it does not assert that all transitivehistorical/output references are published.",
    "No source,main docs,oldreceipt or otherowner artifacts modified; no tests/build/UI/Agent/DB/install performed by publication. Full integration/candidate/installed/realAgent proof belongs to separate receipts."
  ]
